[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我没有妈妈。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没有听过妈妈的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没有见过妈妈的面容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小时候，曾经问过爸爸原因。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当时，爸爸露出了什么样的表情呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经想不起来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，那个表情是我从来都没见过的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是我唯一记得的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我鼓起勇气问他。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有没有留下照片。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"爸爸转移了目光然后说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"全部都扔掉了……"},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i69"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"做了一个越想越觉得难受的梦……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"情绪都低落了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还在想羽未昨天的那句话吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“逃避了……吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一定至今也还在逃避……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"恐怕――……羽未比我还要努力。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"做了每日惯例的广播体操，通过所谓的“登录奖励”，得到了一颗西瓜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回到家，吃完早饭后，就突然无事可做了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“镜子阿姨，整理仓库的事……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11622"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“抱歉哦，我现在还在统计数目，一个人做比较好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“明白了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来当下还没有出场机会。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"电视机只有四个频道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中一个每天都放着同样的健康体操。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未出神地看着电视画面中的健康体操。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过好歹是小学生的暑假。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好好的暑假期间，不应该去留下点快乐的回忆吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你有没有什么想做的事？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15591"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……想做的事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“难得都跑到这么远的岛上了，还是留下一些夏天的回忆再回去吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……想做的事……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“反正仓库的整理工作还不到我出马，现在也闲得慌。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果需要我帮忙的事，我尽力而为。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我觉得是昨晚在羽未身上感觉到的共鸣让我说出了这句话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但羽未似乎对这句话很意外，瞪大了双眼看了我好一会儿。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15476"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"考虑片刻后，她说出的是这个词。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“想做妈妈吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不懂什么意思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“扮家家酒？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我这个年纪玩这个难度有点偏大啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……不是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"谢天谢地。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15482"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“想和妈妈……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15573"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…一起做一些事……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“和妈妈一起做的事吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这我可帮不上忙了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好吧，那让镜子阿姨叫你妈妈来岛上吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……（摇头）”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未摇了摇头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你不愿意吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……不在。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不在？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“不在了……妈妈已经……不在了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……这样啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"问了不该问的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"包括昨天和白羽也是，谈话中踩到了太多的地雷。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不在了……到底是哪个意思呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"离婚……还是过世了呢……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之现在羽未想要妈妈。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我能不能为她做些什么呢……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我们去找找看吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15442"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……找……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看有没有人愿意做羽未的妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15448"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“做我的……妈妈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在这个夏天扮演一对临时母女也未尝不可嘛，我给你找找看。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无非就是复杂一些的扮家家酒游戏。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就算是扮演的也好，只要能和妈妈做想做的事，那羽未的心结多少也会解开一些吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想起了昨天的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哪怕是大半夜的，这岛上的人们也为了羽未而聚集起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉这岛上的人都很善良。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总能找到一个愿意帮忙实现羽未心愿的人吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“行，交给我了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15369"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好了，先找谁好呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i51"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是就选中了和我们一起钓鱼一块吃饭的白羽。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13065"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……又来了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一看见我就用充满警惕的眼神瞪了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一副厌恶的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过这是为了羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不能退步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"与其长篇大论地给她解释，还不如简明扼要地说清楚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“拜托了，当妈妈吧！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13121"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13185"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，喂！白羽！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"逃跑了。"},{"op":"set","variable":117,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍的话感觉挺会照顾人，而且比较爽快说不定顺势就答应了呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好，我去拜托试试。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你有什么事吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“其实是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“希望你能当妈妈！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了让我的热情能传达到，我的言语铿锵有力。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10258"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……唉？妈妈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的，拜托了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哪怕一次也好！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10261"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“一次……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10246"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你…你是认真的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不能再认真了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10172"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……那、那你会温柔一些吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……哈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我觉得她好像误会了什么。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉，还是算了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉，什么意思嘛!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉会在孩子的教育上出现问题，所以我决定郑重地拒绝她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"找找其他人吧。"},{"op":"set","variable":118,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那家伙怎么样？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她好像和羽未也蛮投缘的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且羽未也对那个旅行箱挺感兴趣的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11333"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以呢，你能当妈妈吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11354"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“这叫我怎么回答呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“在羽依里看来，觉得我的年纪已经大到可以当妈妈了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，我不是这个意思。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11303"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“那你是什么意思呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……你…你生气了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“没呢，哪里会生气呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"笑容充满了杀气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……对不起了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11245"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“既然道歉了，说明你真是这样认为的咯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是我错了啊!!”"},{"op":"set","variable":119,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不是有正好适合的人选嘛。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“能当羽未的妈妈吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14396"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我来当羽未的妈妈吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“如果你们不介意的话，那我会努力一试的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的吗？那可真是帮大忙了。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我给你把妈妈带来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14438"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你好，我是你妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你…你好……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那我们玩点什么呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15442"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唔……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那来玩人偶吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14461"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“好呀，我很喜欢人偶的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14529"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那…人偶呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家里根本没有人偶吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15536"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“过来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"朝我招了招手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你来当人偶。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？我？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“好大的人偶先生呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14421"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬张开双手抱了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊！小孩子还看着呢！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15540"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……姆啾！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊！羽未也跟着来了!؟”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":276,"value":["==",["v",6790],5]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊……不过感觉还有点小开心呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对不对！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我可不是萝莉控！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大概……！"},{"op":"goto","target":276},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后被两个人揉捏了一阵子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"结果只是多了一个孩子而已。"},{"op":"set","variable":120,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对了，去拜托那个人试试。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我来当羽未的妈妈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“能拜托你吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13832"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，我明白乳依里的意思了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13810"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“若不嫌弃就让我来帮忙吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的吗？那可真是帮大忙了！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，我把愿意当你妈妈的人带来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13823"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“你好，很高兴再次见到你。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13810"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那，直接来吸吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“吸……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“吸什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“吸奶子呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“让她吸我的奶子就可以了对吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不用害羞的啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13770"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“暂时分别了一段时间，就开始想妈妈了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“所以就想吸奶子了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谁跟你说的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13788"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“没事，你不说我也明白。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，你一点都没明白……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13813"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“当然，我的奶子里没有奶。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不过吸起来应该很舒服的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你在小孩子面前说什么乱七八糟的呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13749"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“咦，正因为是小孩子才要吸奶呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“来，要左边的？还是要右边的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15360"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……好可怕。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你吓到孩子了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13823"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，害羞了嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“（瑟瑟发抖）”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她都吓得瑟瑟发抖了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不利于孩子的教育。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是找其他人吧。"},{"op":"set","variable":121,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然我也不知道合不合适，不过还是拜托那家伙试试吧。"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11718"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“什么？我当妈妈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，拜托了。做做样子就行。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11775"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你是认真的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当然。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“脑子正常？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当然正常了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11766"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“好吧……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔嚓……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你为什么要用Hydro啥来着的东西对着我？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"砰砰砰砰！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊，不要一言不发地开枪啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11792"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“开玩笑也要适可而止。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我才想说这句话呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然不能指望这家伙来扮演妈妈。"},{"op":"set","variable":122,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i28"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然浮现出某个人面孔后，又陷入了犹豫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，那实在是不太妙吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且对方怎么也不可能答应的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“算了，反正就随便拜托试试咯。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i28"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的假的？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"居然答应了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“说到夏日回忆，那便是什么事情都能归咎于天气的炎热。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是嘛？那就拜托了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“交给我了。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"立刻将良一带到家里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，这是你的新妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12193"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嘿！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她似乎不太满意呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“没关系，她很快就会忘掉不满了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12121"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完他脱掉了上衣。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15343"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你是在做什么؟؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12094"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“唉？我在展露泳裤呀？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12075"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“是你让我来秀泳裤的吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你出去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哇，你做什么啊!؟这是泳裤啊!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“慢走不送。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12131"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将半裸的他撵了出去。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15585"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那啥…对不起啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15422"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"set","variable":123,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唉？那家伙？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃，这难度也太大了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，试试也无妨吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i21"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15082"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我去当妈妈？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15078"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……你认真的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，听你这么一问，我也难掩自己内心的犹豫……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你是来戏弄我的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“绝对不是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我认真的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是说出口了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15070"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“呵，那就让我见识一下你的真心吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要我怎么做？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15093"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“这个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"递过来一副球拍。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15125"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“赢了我，我就去当妈妈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15070"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“乒乓球不会撒谎。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想知道的不是乒乓球，而是你的想法。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我就是乒乓球。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好强的魄力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然有些莫名其妙。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好，来就来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是为了羽未。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15070"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“眼神不错。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我可是认真的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15068"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“那我也不能怠慢了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15215"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"摘下了眼镜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“摘掉眼镜会有什么效果？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15216"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“50％。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“50％！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我都全力以赴了，你却这么从容吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这还叫不怠慢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过这样也正合我意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“让我碾压你吧！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15218"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“呼……哈啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“吁……哈……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15220"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“赢…赢了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说夸下了海口，结果还是陷入了苦战。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且还输了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好糗……"},{"op":"set","variable":124,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这下麻烦了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"找不到扮演妈妈的人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这下羽未的心愿就无法完成了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"先前还向她拍胸脯打包票，真是汗颜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…家人吗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在我所知道的范围内，和白羽一起钓鱼是羽未最开心的时候。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就再去求求她吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之前都没有听我把话说完。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再好好和她谈一次吧。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i51"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“又来了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13146"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经开始戒备我了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13136"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嘎啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经近似于敌视了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“希望你能听我说两句。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我详细地说明了羽未的事情。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13071"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是这样一回事……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你看怎么样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13209"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……哦，原来她没有妈妈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她低下头，似乎心有所思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我记得她也没有妈妈……不，是父母都没有。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我该不会说出了残忍的请求吧……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起，我不该对你说这些的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13164"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13059"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“喂，你为什么要做到这种地步。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是为了让羽未留下暑假的回忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就是我的动机了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13076"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“为了几乎没见过面的亲戚家的小孩？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13087"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“为什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个……”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":572,"value":["==",["v",6790],5]},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13065"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“萝莉控？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不…不是啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不禁挪开了视线。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13087"},{"op":"goto","target":572},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但对方却紧紧盯着我看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无论说得多么漂亮，但如果是因为这种事的话，就免谈了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的眼神反复在这样说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她之前说……不想再逃避了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13076"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不想逃避？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但我没有问她是在逃避什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但她只说这个夏天不想再逃避了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一时语塞之后，我看向了白羽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我也是――……逃到这座岛上来的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13087"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在老家发生了烦心事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为了忘掉这些烦心事，所以才来到这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然而，那样的小孩子都说自己不愿逃避了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……所以，我才想尽力帮她。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她好像有想和母亲一起做的事，但对方已经不在了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但我还是想为她实现这个心愿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是我的任性，也是我的自我满足。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13091"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13167"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“西瓜棒。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？西瓜棒？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13164"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我要你在我想吃的时候给我带来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……如果我做到了……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13167"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“作为西瓜棒的回礼，我就当她的妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13170"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这就是我们的合约。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13204"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“如何？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“确定可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13071"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我不知道自己能做到什么……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13062"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但是收了西瓜棒，我也会相应付出的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13125"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谢谢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一把握住白羽的手。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13123"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哇呀؟!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“昨天和你一起钓鱼的时候，羽未真的很开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以才想让你扮演她的母亲。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13129"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“只是扮她的母亲而已……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以，你没必要多余地接近我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，我明白。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13135"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你根本不明白！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13194"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连忙抽出了自己的手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，对不起。一时情不自禁。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……希望你不要误会了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“误会？误会什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13118"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“～～～……没什么啦！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13137"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13071"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那什么时候开始扮演母亲？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“从现在开始。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13063"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“…………唉？”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"事不宜迟，立刻将白羽带到家里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，乐一个吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽说愿意做你的妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你，你好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15525"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……呜哔。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呜哔，那是什么呀？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“人家向你问好呢，你该怎么回人家呀？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15573"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……咕哔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不太能理解。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之羽未显得很僵硬，而且满脸通红。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂，羽未。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她……是在紧张吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看来是认生技能发动了……咦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13199"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仔细一看，原来白羽也紧紧地捏着拳头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……白羽？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13177"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……呼哔？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你紧张了吗……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13084"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“才…才没有紧张呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我只是不知道该对小孩子说什么……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“再说了……我很少……和人说话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你和我聊了挺多呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哪有聊……明明就只是在发火。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……原来那不是交谈吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有些失落。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"孤僻vs认生……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，你不是有事想和妈妈一起做吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一脸惊讶地看向我。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后又看向白羽……随后低下了头。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15568"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“～～～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一言不发地抱着我的腿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她想做的事有那么难为情吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我该怎么做……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃，嗯……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15568"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“～～～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个空间令人无所适从……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i512"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"时间就这样在羽未的沉默不语中慢慢流逝……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连太阳也下山了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i431"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"空气中还残留着日间暑气，围绕着肌肤。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然没有了阳光要好上许多，但走起路来还是满身大汗。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i30"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13167"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真的不用特意送我的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过天都这么黑了呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“结果还是什么都没说呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她看起来一副欲言又止的样子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以白羽才会留到这么晚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不好意思啊，害你白跑了一趟。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13071"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这倒没什么……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13087"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“还要继续吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果可以的话。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13209"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我不知道该做什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个我来想办法。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“比如我会事先问她的意见……没事的，反正我会想办法。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13140"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“西瓜棒。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“明天你会给我吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，我会备好的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13062"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“好。那我就收报酬办事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谢谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"问出羽未想做的事吗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯，到底该怎么做呢……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]